sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant D as Dialer
  participant T as Twilio
  participant P as Prospect
  participant B as Server + Bridge
  participant G as Grok Voice 3.0
  participant H as Hub + Dashboard
  participant V as Vault
  participant C as CRM adapter (CSV by default, or DSB)
  participant A as Licensed agent
  D->>C: listQueue (not DNC, allowlisted or consented, in calling window, under 3 attempts)
  D->>T: create call (stream to tunnel, record, async AMD)
  T->>P: ring
  P-->>T: answers
  T->>B: media stream start (secret, lead params)
  B->>G: open session (script, 9 tools)
  G->>P: "Returning your call about the coverage you saw on TV..."
  loop every turn
    P->>G: speech
    G->>B: tool calls: set_stage, save_facts, log_objection
    B->>H: events, gates checked, state pushed to dashboard
  end
  Note over B,G: Server gates<br/>discovery + alignment before coverage<br/>confirmed recap before quote
  G->>B: get_quote
  B-->>G: 3 options (age from DOB, rate table)
  G->>B: verify_address
  B-->>G: Census-standardized address to read back
  G->>B: secure_mode on
  B->>T: pause recording
  G->>B: save_sensitive (SSN, routing, account, type)
  B->>V: encrypt and store
  B-->>G: last-4 read-backs + bank name
  G->>B: secure_mode off
  B->>T: resume recording
  G->>B: set_stage handoff + transfer_to_agent
  B->>C: writeHandoff (fields, masked note, status)
  B->>T: redirect call: Dial agent
  T->>A: ring, whisper summary
  A-->>P: connected, agent reviews and submits
